              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.description",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>★★★★★</p><p>This review is pertaining to the doggy daycare service above the cafe. I’ve been taking my dog there since she was a puppy, and the ladies who care for the dogs there are absolutely stellar. Total professionals, they really are qualified and understand dogs and how to manage them, socialize them and make sure they have a fabulous time. They also make sure the dogs have “downtime” and opportunities to rest in between play. Which mean your dog come home exhausted, but not “wired” if that makes sense! My dog loves being there so much, and it’s worth every penny. Can recommend them highly enough.</p>",
