                "text": "<p>★★★★★</p><p>My mini schnauzer, Hilde, goes to Love my Human twice a week for daycare on the days I work from home. She loves it so much, it really makes me so happy taking her there. When we get there she runs up the stairs and goes crazy when she gets to the room with all her ‘friends’. Not only am I so happy that she seems to love it there, but the girls who work in the daycare are so good with her and all the dogs. I feel very comfortable as I know I’m leaving her in very good hands!</p>",
